              "richtext": {
                "richtext_tags": []
              },
              "text": "how to run an automated local media brand on $84/mo:\n\n1/ @apify scrapes text, flyers, and links straight from WhatsApp groups. luna extracts the details\n\n2/ scoring prompt runs for audience fit and organizes into SEND, SAVE, or SKIP \n\n3/ @Brave + @firecrawl get any missing addresses, map links and ticket links\n\n4/ @ScrapeCreators grabs the organizers socials from Insta + TikTok\n\n5/ Sonnet rewrites the raw scraped copy into brand voice + adds map/calendar/tags\n\n6/ @Webflow MCP pushes live events to your calendar site\n\n7/ @beehiiv MCP drafts the top 7 events into your weekly newsletter template\n\n8/ 72-hour click metrics auto-feed back into the step 2 scoring engine to improve next week's picks"
            }
